{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>THE NIGHTMARE</strong> <br>Take on the role of Mike, a lonely child who has suffered a tragic accident. Now in critical condition, your thoughts fixate on a single dream: a visit to the circus. As your life hangs by a thread, a demonic entity grants your final wish, but it wants your pure soul in return. <br> <br>The circus you longed for is fusing with your memories, twisting into your worst nightmare. You must survive and escape... before it consumes you. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709810/extras/circus_tent_panning.gif?t=1750474229\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<br><strong>BEWARE OF THE CLOWN</strong><br>The demon has taken the form of a monstrous clown, stalking through your thoughts and drawn to the slightest sound. Move carefully, and use your small size for hiding to evade it.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709810/extras/ball_pit_zoom_out.gif?t=1750474229\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<br><strong>COLLECT THE POSTERS</strong><br>Hidden circus posters act as seals, keeping you trapped in this mental prison. Gathering them all is your only chance to clear your mind and survive.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709810/extras/poster_pickup.gif?t=1750474229\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<br><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ever-present monstrous clown that can hear you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tense stealth gameplay focused on sneaking, hiding, and escaping.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Freeform exploration. The\u00a0eerie circus is an open area to discover as you want.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple endings. Immerse yourself in a dramatic story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GAME LENGTH</strong><br>20-60 minutes.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3709810?t=1750474229","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3709810?t=1750474229","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709810/3905291f1646639c5e90c437744eab961c88f93b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750474229","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709810/3905291f1646639c5e90c437744eab961c88f93b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750474229","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3720280,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>THE NIGHTMARE</strong> <br>Take on the role of Mike, a lonely child who has suffered a tragic accident. Now in critical condition, your thoughts fixate on a single dream: a visit to the circus. As your life hangs by a thread, a demonic entity grants your final wish, but it wants your pure soul in return. <br> <br>The circus you longed for is fusing with your memories, twisting into your worst nightmare. You must survive and escape... before it consumes you. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709810/extras/circus_tent_panning.gif?t=1750474229\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<br><strong>BEWARE OF THE CLOWN</strong><br>The demon has taken the form of a monstrous clown, stalking through your thoughts and drawn to the slightest sound. Move carefully, and use your small size for hiding to evade it.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709810/extras/ball_pit_zoom_out.gif?t=1750474229\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<br><strong>COLLECT THE POSTERS</strong><br>Hidden circus posters act as seals, keeping you trapped in this mental prison. Gathering them all is your only chance to clear your mind and survive.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709810/extras/poster_pickup.gif?t=1750474229\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<br><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ever-present monstrous clown that can hear you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tense stealth gameplay focused on sneaking, hiding, and escaping.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Freeform exploration. The\u00a0eerie circus is an open area to discover as you want.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple endings. Immerse yourself in a dramatic story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GAME LENGTH</strong><br>20-60 minutes.</p>","developers":["Juan Pablo Cardoso"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709810/1df74d4b32653a5544d03357bfb8c4b79808eb69/header.jpg?t=1750474229","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257154553,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257154553/movie480.mp4?t=1750351473","max":"http: